NOTE ON DATA
============

The data files in this repository (`kodepos.csv`, `kodepos.json`,
`kodepos_parsed.csv`, `kodepos_parsed.json`, `kodepos.db`) are re-publications
of factual government reference data scraped from a public website
(nomor.net, 2026-08-21). The underlying data — Indonesian postal codes
(kode pos) and Kemendagri administrative region codes (kode wilayah) — are
public facts and are not subject to copyright in any jurisdiction.

The MIT license above applies only to the source code (`scrape.py`,
`build_sqlite.py`, `build_parsed.py`, `README.md`) and to the data
organization choices (column names, decomposed Kemendagri fields,
SQLite schema, indexes) made by this repository.

If you are a rights holder and would like attribution changed, please
open an issue.